{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdXqtJWfHcXwvFWZ5cw6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Moonshot put Kimi K3.1 Pro on its API on October 23 and gave itself until November 4, 2026 to release the weights, a window of twelve days. The company's wording, quoted in the article, is \"Full model weights will be released by Nov 4, 2026.\" During that window the model is available through Moonshot's service and nowhere else, and everything the article reports about its quality was gathered on that hosted version.\n\nThat evidence has two parts. Artificial Analysis scored the model at 55, which is ahead of Claude Fable 5.1, GPT-6 Astra and Gemini 4 Argon at 53 each and behind Claude Opus 5.5 at 58. Moonshot's own benchmarks show it approximately level with Opus 5.5 and GPT-6 Astra, ahead on a few tests and close on others. The article's author concludes that no model with open weights, or about to have them, has scored this highly against the frontier before. The conclusion depends on the release going ahead, since until the weights are published the model is a hosted product like its competitors.\n\nThe article does not discuss whether the published weights will match the model served through the API, and it gives no details of the release format or license. Those questions cannot be answered from what the author reports, and they determine how much of the API-based score carries over to anyone running the model themselves.\n\nCost is the one practical point the article does settle. The API charges $2.00 per million input tokens and $10 per million output tokens, equal to GPT-6.1 Sol and half the price of Claude Opus 5.5. Anyone using the hosted model before the weights arrive is paying those rates, with a Highspeed option that runs 2-3x faster at twice the price. The author also ran a pelican-on-a-bicycle SVG prompt at the low, medium and max reasoning levels and compared it with Kimi K3, but the excerpt does not say what that comparison showed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1170,"cache_read_input_tokens":6105,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1170},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ec212ea-5e83-4866-b5f5-5669c9cacf73","uuid":"736b67da-cb84-4d5b-be0a-5efb8e3bcb90","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:15:53.878Z","request_id":"req_011CgdXqt486cbzPWCwJtz1V"}
